mpensation: $1.1M (FY2025)","culture_narrative":"Employs approximately 371 people. Revenue per employee of $459K ranks in the above the sector median among Healthcare peers, with revenue growing 37%/yr across its filed history. Stock-based compensation of $93K per employee reflects an ownership culture. CEO compensation is 2\u00d7 revenue per employee (modest relative to workforce productivity). Governance score flags elevated compensation governance risk (7/10).","financial_summary":["REGENXBIO Inc. is a small-cap healthcare business with a $505M market cap on $170M of annual revenue.","The top line has compounded at +15% over the past three years and +37% annually across the full decade, the kind of sustained demand persistence that marks a compounder.","Returns on capital run at -1250% against a 11% cost of capital, which means the business is destroying value with every dollar it reinvests.","The company is burning through $126M of cash, and without positive owner earnings any valuation rests on hope rather than evidence.","On the balance sheet, thin -3.6\u00d7 interest coverage leaves no room for a bad year.","Shareholder yield is only 0.0%, a thin return of capital, and stock-based comp at 20% of revenue is silent dilution an owner has to account for, and insiders hold 6.5% of the shares, and profit capture is only 0.0\u00d7 the fair share, suggesting no structural edge inside its industry."],"sector_headwinds":[{"text":"Piotroski score 3/9 \u2014 the fundamentals are deteriorating on multiple fronts","sev":"red","cat":"quality"},{"text":"Altman Z in the distress zone (-3.0) \u2014 the kind of balance-sheet risk that can make a loss permanent","sev":"red","cat":"quality"},{"text":"Very elevated short interest (16.3% of float) \u2014 sophisticated money is betting against the business","sev":"red","cat":"sentiment"},{"text":"ROIC sits in the bottom decile among Healthcare peers \u2014 no moat advantage to speak of","sev":"red","cat":"moat"},{"text":"Operating margins 94% below sector median \u2014 a cost disadvantage the moat cannot hide","sev":"amber","cat":"moat"},{"text":"Fragmented industry with below-average profit capture \u2014 no moat to protect margins","sev":"amber","cat":"moat"},{"text":"Value-trap profile (score 62/100): leveraged balance sheet under pressure; roic below cost of capital \u2014 cheapness may reflect deterioration, not mispricing","sev":"amber","cat":"value_trap"},{"text":"Patent cliffs, drug-pricing reform, and reimbursement pressure \u2014 a single regulatory change can reset the pricing power that justifies the multiple.","sev":"amber","cat":"thesis_risk"},{"text":"Clinical trial concentration risk \u2014 binary FDA outcomes on a lead asset can wipe out billions in market cap in a single session.","sev":"amber","cat":"thesis_risk"},{"text":"GLP-1 disruption across sub-sectors \u2014 weight-loss drugs are reshaping demand for orthopaedics, cardiovascular devices, and sleep-apnea treatments in ways not yet priced in.","sev":"amber","cat":"thesis_risk"}],"sector_tailwinds":["Valued at a 120% discount to sector median EV/EBITDA","Healthcare sector showing strong relative momentum, outperforming the market by 13% over 3 months","Healthcare ETF in a sustained uptrend above its long-term average","Strong 6-month sector performance (30.7% return)"],"news_headlines":[{"title":"REGENXBIO (NASDAQ:RGNX) Shares Climb 13.6% \u2013 Here\u2019s Why","source":"thelincolnianonline.com","link":"https://www.thelincolnianonline.com/2026/11/13/regenxbio-nasdaqrgnx-shares-climb-13-6-heres-why.html","date":"2026-11-13","timestamp":1794582087.0,"origin":"tiingo","sentiment":0.878,"tier":0,"scope":"company","tags":[]},{"title":"Precision Trading with Regenxbio Inc. (RGNX) Risk Zones","source":"news.stocktradersdaily.com","link":"https://news.stocktradersdaily.com/news_release/10/Precision_Trading_with_Regenxbio_Inc._RGNX_Risk_Zones_111326072801_1794572881.html","date":"2026-11-13","timestamp":1794572881.0,"origin":"ti